    "title": "Budget domains 2027",
    "abstract": "Defines two budget domains for 2027 under the budget set up in the referenced process action.",
    "motivation": "Withdrawals for 2027 should be traceable per domain.",
    "rationale": "Core Infrastructure pays into one administrator account with a ceiling. Community only groups its actions.",
